      "heading": "Introduction",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "Bows is a weapon class.\nBows shoot equipped arrows that cannot be retrieved. Holding down the primary attack button draws the bow back, improving accuracy and damage when the arrow is released. Blocking cancels a draw without firing the arrow.\nBows have 2.5 seconds of draw time at skill level 0, which decreases to a draw time of 0.5 seconds by level 100. However, the bow can only be fired every 0.8 seconds, which can be reached at skill level 85."
